From 284c63139046f31b57f640ecdfac87fdace59c54 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: azrialwork <azrial.work@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 23:26:37 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(cli): remove the self-update feature entirely

Delete the upgrade command (and its update alias), the Updater service with its background checks against the update API, the update preflight handoff screen, the TUI update dialog/notification/banner and /update command, the installation.update-available/updated server events, and the update/autoupdate config settings (existing configs now omit them as unsupported legacy settings). Install-method detection and package removal move to a small InstallMethod service so uninstall keeps working unchanged.
